Subject: Re: surface sliding semilandmarks in patches
Message-ID: <C4-biSD32TY.UuTJtnCBBAAJ@geomorph-r-package.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <C4-biSD32TY.ViIqxlDFAgAJ@geomorph-r-package.groups.google.com>
